d that we're going to  use it for many many many years to come  and this will generate revenue so this  was the first first level and then after  I think we have done a decent job in  terms of education of the bank and  really we know how about so access to  final things who bank loans at at good  conditions so I would say that we have  secured so far the financing toward to  build those networks fantastic well  thank you for talking to us and I hope  you continue to rise to the challenge in  France thank you Brian  [Music]  you

